-- src:13078 | 265 Companies Act 1967 2020 Ed.
-- src:13080 | (a) the date on which the director or chief executive officer
-- src:13081 | became a director or chief executive officer (as the case
-- src:13082 | may be); or
-- src:13084 | (b) (if already a director or chief executive officer, as the case
