GIVEN `the transaction is to meet expenditure incurred or to be incurred for the purposes of the company or to enable the director to perform his or her duties, section 162(3)(a)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the transaction is for a home of a director in full-time employment, section 162(3)(b)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `another such transaction for a home is outstanding` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 162(3)(a) or (b) the transaction is within one of the two paragraphs` MEANS
    `the transaction is to meet expenditure incurred or to be incurred for the purposes of the company or to enable the director to perform his or her duties, section 162(3)(a)`
    OR (`the transaction is for a home of a director in full-time employment, section 162(3)(b)` AND (NOT `another such transaction for a home is outstanding`))

